        "gg18XtWM65B_text": "<p><span style=\"color:#E87010;\">FAQ</span></p>",
        "gg2rmIEa67h_text": "<p>For eye tracking to work accurately, your headset needs to be correctly positioned on your head and in front of your eyes. Please see detailed instructions for positioning the headset and using eye tracking.</p>",
        "gg4WumM5cKO_text": "<p>For eye tracking to work accurately, your headset needs to be correctly positioned on your head and in front of your eyes. Please see detailed instructions for positioning the headset and using eye tracking.</p>",
        "ggC8U51JWoM_text": "<p>Votre question :&nbsp;</p>",
